            <ArticleTitle>Lumbar spine injury in the athlete.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>419-48</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In summary, the keys to proper management of lumbar spine problems in athletes include (1) comprehensive diagnosis; (2) aggressive, effective nonoperative care; and (3) pinpointing operations that do as little damage as possible to normal tissue but correct the pathologic lesion.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
